WEBVTT

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:32.042
and cis allies are tired, too.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.309
Tired of being told they're doing it wrong

00:00:36.333 --> 00:00:39.750
or that it isn't even their place
to show up at all.

00:00:40.542 --> 00:00:44.893
This fatigue is impacting all of us.

00:00:44.917 --> 00:00:46.476
And in fact,

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.268
I believe we won't succeed

00:00:49.292 --> 00:00:52.792
until we approach justice in a new way.

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:58.351
I grew up in the middle
of the civil rights movement

00:00:58.375 --> 00:01:00.333
in the segregated South.